@naivg/dsh-network README · Sidebar web search：The dsh web UI gains a **Web Search** entry in the sidebar, after Plugins and
Schedules. The panel runs the same search path as the `web_search` tool and is
gated by the same toggle.

@naivg/dsh-network README · Quick start：Nothing needs configuring on a fresh install: the default chain is keyless,
and an engine that would cost you something (or need a server of yours) is
never enabled behind your back.
